{"id":1749519,"retrievedAt":"2026-08-15T11:41:11.396Z","response":{"adult":false,"backdrop_path":null,"belongs_to_collection":null,"budget":0,"genres":[],"homepage":"","id":1749519,"imdb_id":null,"origin_country":["US"],"original_language":"en","original_title":"Madu 3 Suku","overview":"# The Story of Haji Rahim  Haji Rahim already has two wives and his wives get along well with each other. However, Haji Rahim feels increasingly neglected by the attention and affection of his two wives. Melati, his first wife, is busy with her association and managing other people's matters. Meanwhile, Kuntum, his second wife, is occupied with her bakery business and is also facing competition from Borhan, her former husband. Haji Rahim feels neglected and decides to take a solo vacation to cheer himself up. While on vacation, he encounters something unexpected. Haji Rahim meets Seroja. Seroja's cheerful, humorous and affectionate appearance attracts him. Haji Rahim feels himself falling in love again, but initially tries to restrain himself. Until Haji Rahim becomes involved in an incident saving Seroja from becoming a victim of jealousy, and because of that, Haji Rahim can no longer contain his feelings for Seroja. Haji Rahim wants to marry Seroja.","popularity":0.0071,"poster_path":"/9mYD6Dm8RA13tF0SaOgamlVWKIx.jpg","production_companies":[],"production_countries":[],"release_date":"2017-01-01","revenue":0,"runtime":0,"softcore":false,"spoken_languages":[],"status":"Released","tagline":"","title":"Madu 3 Suku","video":false,"vote_average":0,"vote_count":0,"alternative_titles":{"titles":[]},"credits":{"cast":[{"adult":false,"gender":2,"id":1275338,"known_for_department":"Acting","name":"Eizlan Yusof","original_name":"Eizlan Yusof","popularity":0.5069,"profile_path":"/eqS7mGlqQkHRPZjlSBWYIZKpEja.jpg","cast_id":2,"character":"","credit_id":"6a7f436044bcbb2cefbf9234","order":0},{"adult":false,"gender":1,"id":1245310,"known_for_department":"Acting","name":"Jasmin Hamid","original_name